        "title": "VaultCreateRequest",
        "description": "Request schema for creating a vault item. All blobs MUST be client-side encrypted before submission (Phase 3.1 contract). For AES-GCM, the cryptographic contract uses Additional Authenticated Data (AAD) built as UTF8(NFC(user_id)) + 0x1F + UTF8(NFC(item_id)) + 0x1F + UTF8(NFC(service_name)) in the exact field order user_id, item_id, service_name. AAD is part of the encryption contract and is not exposed as a direct API field."
      },
